00:03:52.845 --> 00:03:55.423
and i was pinging him
about this hot angel deal.

00:03:55.423 --> 00:03:57.884
And he said, "No, I don't
do angel deals anymore."

00:03:57.884 --> 00:03:59.695
And then I pinged him about a talk.

00:03:59.695 --> 00:04:01.134
And he says, "No, no I'm not gonna talk."

00:04:01.134 --> 00:04:03.619
