00:04:09.888 --> 00:04:10.886
This is it.

00:04:10.886 --> 00:04:12.303
This is the job I'm gonna
do for the rest of my life,

00:04:12.303 --> 00:04:13.789
and this is my career.

00:04:13.789 --> 00:04:15.659
I already, clearly,

00:04:15.659 --> 00:04:19.559
am on my second oofy business.

00:04:19.559 --> 00:04:21.329
I think I've got two
more, three more in me.

00:04:21.329 --> 00:04:22.886
And so, I'm gonna be an
entrepreneur that has,

00:04:22.886 --> 00:04:24.906
you know, four or five businesses,

00:04:24.906 --> 00:04:26.926
