00:04:26.926 --> 00:04:28.040
Clintus.

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:31.639
And so, I think it comes
down to who you are, right?

00:04:31.639 --> 00:04:32.777
And what you want.

00:04:32.777 --> 00:04:34.472
